  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GFp1Fxm.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EiTamXH.png\" alt=\"信息\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <h3><strong>本资源包需要安装以下模组才能正常运行：</strong></h3>\n  <ol>\n  <li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></strong></li>\n  <li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a></strong></li>\n  <li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></strong></li>\n  <li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpolytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polytone</a></strong></li>\n  </ol>\n</blockquote>\n<h1>Summit：我的世界之巅</h1>\n<p><strong>Summit</strong> 是一款面向《我的世界》的写实风格材质包，旨在为游戏增添一抹自然之美。其设计细腻精致，且兼容多种硬件配置。</p>\n<h2>Summit 64x 现已免费开放！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/4c38877ef6a47aed4fa05e3d8dfe5fb9122d1596.jpeg\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/ac2ccf21f0dcce54a49f12cbf36174217352c912_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/5c0dcc8a14c3b92d67f44262b88b3d286d64fa84_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/55e02c25c1dda728cf1e6c64a7e5abb4c46e631d_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/00b13804c46b2d7323faff3bc74e69eca6b1722e_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/69eebad1671ae9522c15001da48de45ad49e71d7_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/14f6e4bfad1958c08ddc6d8d045c4da6c9b09300_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/c617b10da241bba3e2e33620da4fc17a0d75db59_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xb8whpNI/images/aac67fc42c278aa4e73b6255942a49a0b9be9931_350.webp\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<h2>特性：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>丰富的分辨率选项：</strong>提供 16x 至 64x 多种规格，可根据您的设备性能自由选择。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>平衡的写实风格：</strong>精心优化的贴图，完美契合《我的世界》的美学基调。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>性能优化：</strong>流畅高效的游戏体验。\n<p><strong>用 Summit 重新发现我的世界！</strong></p></li>\n</ul>",
